# L §5.11 / §4.3: "Inside as if {law D}, every at reader def is read at D, and an input read directly in the ask
# too."  rate is 1 until 2025-12-31 and 2 from 2026 (a replace); y reads it at reader.  "A superseded law stays
# runnable inside as if {law 2021-12-31}" (N-908): y as if {law 2025-06-30} reads the 2025 row.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"

input rate: int

def y: int at reader
  rule base = rate

version v1
  cite s
  governs 2025..
  known 2025-01-01
  rate = 1

version v2
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2025-12-01
  replace rate = 2

ask q1: y law 2026-06-30
ask q2: y as if {law 2025-06-30}
ask q3: rate as if {law 2025-06-30}
=== expect
q1: 2
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-12-31
q2: 1
  pinned: law 2025-06-30
  cut 2026-12-31
q3: 1
  pinned: law 2025-06-30
  cut 2026-12-31
